        Friends, not users
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base text-mist mt-6 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        A personal agent talks to many people, with different stakes and different histories. A single USER.md cannot hold that. The substrate has to.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-mist mt-4">Ari Mendelow &middot; April 2026</p>
